### Maven Shade plugin ###
# Written into the project root every time `mvn package` runs
dependency-reduced-pom.xml

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# The whole directory, rather than named files. Anyone cloning this opens it in
# their own IDE, which regenerates it; workspace.xml in particular is local state
# (open tabs, run history, window layout) and creates noise in every diff.
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

